# Course 4 (MILL; docs/plans/bonanza-courses/MILL.md): WINDMILL LANE, a windmill MINIGOLF course - the
# prototype's first windmill and bumper box, a FORK into two tubes (an open one to the RUBBER way: a turntable
# and a second windmill; one behind an ARCHWAY over a glass pad to the GLASS way: a respawning jump and a gap
# it must make), a rejoin, and a CUP in a sandpit.  ATTEMPT 1, SHIPPED (2026-11-21; the prototype's features
# are TMIL's, the test copy): written by docs/plans/bonanza-courses/mill/sketch.py --bbc --force while the
# layout moves.
course MILL "Windmill Lane"
guide                     # a REAL course: held to the course guide's checkable rules
music windmill
width 128
origin 672                # 1,024 px: the reach runs from about px -620 (the finish) to +250 (over B)
ball rubber
uses rotor tube turntable seesaw archway spring life
medals 60 70
limit 99
target 90
stop down                 # SPEC.md 130.45.4: past the cup the camera scrolls no further down (the finish clock stays in view)

# rooms (the sketch's sections) and walls
floor rect   7   9  13  14  flat 28   # A
wall  rect   8   5  12   9  flat 34
floor rect  12   5  16   9  flat 32   # B
surface bounce rect 18 17 19 22
floor rect  18  41  25  43  flat 14   # V
floor rect  21  43  23  45  flat 14   # V
floor rect  21  45  23  47  ramp y 45 47 14 10   # V
floor rect  19  47  32  50  flat 10   # J
floor rect 23 50 26 51 ramp y 50 51 10 9    # J

# guard rails: every open edge but the design's (the jump's gap, the back door's step, the arch's legs)
# guard rails ON the floors' edges (SPEC.md 130.35.1: the rail stands on the floor, the edge a wall to the ball at every height)
guard rect  15   5  16   9 side +x
guard tile  22  43 side +x
guard rect  12   5  16   6 side -y
guard tile   7   9 side -y
guard tile  19  47 side -y
