guard rect 27 26 28 28
guard rect 26 20 30 21 side -y
guard rect 35 20 36 22
guard rect 12 13 13 14
guard rect 12 13 13 14 side +y
guard rect 27 27 28 29 side +x +y
guard rect 18 38 25 39 side +y
guard rect 34 29 36 30
guard rect 29 44 30 46
guard rect 29 47 32 48
guard rect 26 47 27 50 side -x

# the first windmill (the prototype's right one): a KEEP tube through its house, entered -y from the tee
tube keep   9 9  12 6  via 9 6
prop windmill 9 9  seed 16
# the bumper box (the prototype's): three posts, the DROP tube out of its east rail onto the bunker
prop bumper 12 18
prop bumper 14 17
prop bumper 14 19
# the SEE-SAW: F's teeter down to the plaza (SPEC.md 130.42), resting with its near (minus) end down
seesaw 22 17 24 21 along y pivot 17
# the FORK: the open tube (the rubber way) and the ARCHWAY over a glass pad (SPEC.md 130.39) before the
# glass way's tube
# the rubber way's TURNTABLE (SPEC.md 130.43): the middle column open on every other quarter turn
prop turntable 26 35 size 3 fill ooo.o..o. seed 228
# the second windmill: entered -x off U, out of its house's +y face onto the rejoin
tube drop 15 18 20 15 via 17 18 via 17 15 height 2 body 20
tube launch 11 35 15 37 via 11 37 speed 336 0 332 body 21.5 column 0.5
tube keep 29 28 20 34 via 28 28 via 28 31 via 20 31
tube keep 27 44 21 41 via 27 43 via 25 43 via 25 40 via 21 40
# the glass way: a respawning JUMP (SPEC.md 130.25.9, 130.55) on the ledge, the rubber pads past the gap
prop life 10 34 once
prop windmill 29 28
prop bumper 27 41
prop windmill 27 44
pad glass 20 27
# the finish: the CUP in a sandpit (SPEC.md 130.14.4.3; MOON's ring)
cup 24 52

start 9 12
checkpoint 20 37               # flag 1
checkpoint 11 34 ball glass   # flag 2
checkpoint 23 27
checkpoint 22 15
checkpoint 33 41
checkpoint 28 48
checkpoint 35 21

