# warnings this course keeps (SPEC.md 130.58.5; docs/plans/bonanza-courses/MILL.md section 8, and section 9's
# research item on the windmill's occluder stop)
# the first windmill (line 71): A's east guard rail (line 47) stands on the raised ramp R and its west end reaches
# the lower right corner of a ball's box at (10, 9) - a corner of a box, mostly clear of a round ball's sprite
accept shade 10 9
# the second windmill (line 89): what (31, 28) and (31, 29) draw reaches 8 px into a ball's box in the doorway's
# east cells - a sliver, and it shows only on a frame whose rotor turns its gate (SPEC.md 130.12.4.6)
accept shade 29 27
# the third windmill (line 91): the guard rails on lines 65 and 66 barely clip a ball's box in its doorway's
# 3 x 3 (16 px over the floor) - a sliver of rail, only while the rotor turns
accept shade 27 44
# the glass pad under the archway (line 92): half its top is under the arch's near leg, as it would be under any
# single high arch along x - the other half and the arch over it say where it is
accept mark 20 27
